  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Retention of the outbuilding, canopy, boiler house and raised platforms\n",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;The canopy, by reason of its excessive, additional depth beyond the 6m rear extension, would result in an unduly dominant and overbearing form of development. Furthermore, Its scale and projection would unacceptably impact the amenity of the neighbouring property, specifically No. 22 Clifton Road, causing harm to outlook and creating a sense of enclosure. As such, the proposal fails to respect the amenities of adjoining occupiers and is therefore contrary to &lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;National\r\nPlanning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), Core\r\nPolicy CS1 (B) of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), policy DM 1 of the Harrow\r\nDevelopment Management Policies Local Plan (2013), the adopted Supplementary\r\nPlanning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010) and policy GR1 of the emerging Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0cm;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal, by reason of the site being located within an area liable to flooding has failed to provide a comprehensive Flood Risk Assessment and has failed to demonstrate that the proposed development would not exacerbate the risk of flooding within the site or increase the risk and consequences of flooding elsewhere, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy SI12 of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.U of Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM9 of the Harrow Development Management Polices Local Plan (2013) and policies GR1 and CN3 of the Emerging Harrow Local&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-indent: -18pt;&quot;&gt;Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:0cm;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;mso-layout-grid-align:\r\nnone;text-autospace:none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
